WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read the period and snapshot
Check the workspace. Period metrics and current queues answer different
questions. Choose the reporting period and read the generated time
before comparing figures.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check participation and workspace
Confirm the active store in the header, then read its Workspace terms.
Approval in one store does not approve every other workspace.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Separate profile, documents and payout accounts
Check the workspace. Profile, addresses, documents and payout accounts
are separate tabs. Updating public profile text does not approve a
document or verify a payout account.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Separate staff roles and accounts
Check the workspace. Read each staff member’s role and active/blocked
state. Staff permissions govern dashboard actions; customer groups do
not grant these permissions.

